{"seq":3,"slug":"gig-earning-settlement","title":"众包运力报酬结算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdsourced-elastic-lastmile/crowd-quality-settlement/gig-earning-settlement","wordCount":1949,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"众包运力报酬结算\">众包运力报酬结算</h1><p>一个骑手在 App 里看到&quot;本单收入 12.50 元&quot;，这个数字背后至少叠了六项：基础费、距离费、时段溢价、天气附加、冲单奖的分摊、以及上一单扣罚的冲销。真正让这套系统难做的不是加总，而是<strong>每一分钱都要有出处、可解释、可对账</strong>——司机申诉时你能指出&quot;这 12.50 元由哪几笔构成、每笔依据什么规则、对应的订单与时间是什么&quot;，平台财务对账时借贷必须严丝合缝地平。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-订单级分账与司机级账本\">核心概念：订单级分账与司机级账本</h2><h3 id=\"两个粒度的账\">两个粒度的账</h3><p>结算系统有两个必须分开的粒度。<strong>订单级分账</strong>回答&quot;这一单产生了多少应付给司机的钱&quot;；<strong>司机级账本</strong>回答&quot;这个司机当前应收多少、已付多少、还差多少&quot;。前者是一次性的会计分录，后者是持续累积的余额。把它们混在一张表里，会出现&quot;司机账本的余额无法与订单明细对上&quot;的经典问题。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>主键</th>\n<th>记录内容</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>订单分账</td>\n<td>order_id + identity_id</td>\n<td>该单的报酬构成、扣罚、状态</td>\n<td>每单一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>司机账本</td>\n<td>identity_id + currency</td>\n<td>累计应收、已结算、挂账、可提现</td>\n<td>持续</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结算批次</td>\n<td>batch_id</td>\n<td>一次打款覆盖的订单集合</td>\n<td>每次打款</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"费用项的清单化\">费用项的清单化</h3><p>报酬构成必须是一张<strong>清单</strong>而不是一个数字，这不只是为了可解释性，也是为了对账时可归因。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE earning_line (&#10;  line_id        BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  order_id       BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  identity_id    BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  line_type      TEXT NOT NULL,   -- base|distance|surge|weather|bonus|penalty|adjust&#10;  amount_cents   BIGINT NOT NULL, -- 可为负（扣罚与冲销）&#10;  currency       CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  rule_ref       TEXT NOT NULL,   -- 规则版本号，用于事后复核&#10;  computed_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  CONSTRAINT uq_line UNIQUE (order_id, identity_id, line_type, rule_ref)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE courier_ledger_entry (&#10;  entry_id       BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  identity_id    BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  currency       CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  entry_type     TEXT NOT NULL,   -- accrual|payout|hold|release|adjust&#10;  amount_cents   BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  balance_after  BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  source_ref     TEXT NOT NULL,   -- 结算批次号或订单号&#10;  created_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  CONSTRAINT uq_ledger UNIQUE (identity_id, source_ref, entry_type)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> earning_line</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  line_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  identity_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  line_type      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- base|distance|surge|weather|bonus|penalty|adjust</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount_cents   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 可为负（扣罚与冲销）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_ref       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 规则版本号，用于事后复核</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  computed_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uq_line </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_id, identity_id, line_type, rule_ref)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> courier_ledger_entry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entry_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  identity_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entry_type     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- accrual|payout|hold|release|adjust</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount_cents   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  balance_after  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_ref     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 结算批次号或订单号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uq_ledger </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (identity_id, source_ref, entry_type)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两处唯一约束是这套设计的核心防护。<code>uq_line</code> 保证同一单同一费用项同一规则版本只能记一次——重试、重复消费、并发结算都不会造成重复入账。<code>uq_ledger</code> 保证同一来源的同一类型分录只能记一次，这正是幂等分录的标准做法。</p>\n<h3 id=\"幂等分录与余额\">幂等分录与余额</h3><p>账本分录必须是<strong>只增不改</strong>的（append-only），余额通过 <code>balance_after</code> 字段体现而不是 UPDATE 一个余额值。这样做的原因是：任何对历史分录的修改都会使对账失去依据。需要更正时，追加一笔反向分录（<code>entry_type = &#39;adjust&#39;</code>，金额为负），而不是改旧记录。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">balance\\_after_n = balance\\_after_{n-1} + amount_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ce</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ce</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">am</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条恒等式应当在每次写入时校验，并在每日对账任务里全量重算一次与存量比对。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[订单妥投] --&gt; B[生成 earning_line 清单]&#10;  B --&gt; C[汇总到 courier_ledger_entry accrual]&#10;  D[妥投争议裁定失败] --&gt; E[生成 penalty 行]&#10;  E --&gt; C&#10;  F[奖励达成] --&gt; G[生成 bonus 行]&#10;  G --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; H{是否过冻结期?}&#10;  H --&gt;|否| I[hold: 暂不可提现]&#10;  H --&gt;|是| J[release: 可提现]&#10;  J --&gt; K[结算批次 batch]&#10;  K --&gt; L[打款通道]&#10;  L --&gt; M[回调确认 → payout 分录]&#10;  M --&gt; N[每日对账: 重算余额 + 通道流水比对]\">graph TD\n  A[订单妥投] --&gt; B[生成 earning_line 清单]\n  B --&gt; C[汇总到 courier_ledger_entry accrual]\n  D[妥投争议裁定失败] --&gt; E[生成 penalty 行]\n  E --&gt; C\n  F[奖励达成] --&gt; G[生成 bonus 行]\n  G --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; H{是否过冻结期?}\n  H --&gt;|否| I[hold: 暂不可提现]\n  H --&gt;|是| J[release: 可提现]\n  J --&gt; K[结算批次 batch]\n  K --&gt; L[打款通道]\n  L --&gt; M[回调确认 → payout 分录]\n  M --&gt; N[每日对账: 重算余额 + 通道流水比对]</pre><p>图中的 <code>H</code> 是关键的一步：<strong>冻结期</strong>。妥投争议、退款、以及质检抽查都需要时间窗口，因此司机的报酬不能立即变为可提现。冻结期的长度需与争议窗口匹配，通常 3–7 天。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结算周期与打款\">结算周期与打款</h2><h3 id=\"周期选择的经济含义\">周期选择的经济含义</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>周期</th>\n<th>司机体验</th>\n<th>平台资金占用</th>\n<th>运营复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>即时（每单到账）</td>\n<td>最好</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（打款笔数巨大、手续费高）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日结</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周结</td>\n<td>一般</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半月/月结</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>众包网络的司机多为现金流敏感人群，因此日结或&quot;随时提现 + 单笔手续费&quot;是主流选择。这里的权衡是<strong>打款笔数与手续费</strong>：每单即时打款的固定手续费会吃掉小额订单的利润，因此通常是&quot;余额累积到阈值后自动打款&quot;或&quot;司机主动提现&quot;。</p>\n<p>即时性在通道层面已经不再是瓶颈：美国联邦储备的 FedNow 服务于 2023 年 7 月 20 日上线，设计目标是 7×24×365 不间断处理，并提供&quot;请求付款&quot;（request for payment）等可选能力（<a href=\"https://www.federalreserve.gov/paymentsystems/fednow_about.htm\">Federal Reserve: About FedNow</a>）。这意味着&quot;日结&quot;在技术上可以做到真正的秒级到账，选择更长的结算周期因此从技术限制变成了<strong>风险控制选择</strong>——冻结期存在的意义是留出争议处理窗口，而不是等通道清算。</p>\n<h3 id=\"打款通道的失败处理\">打款通道的失败处理</h3><p>打款不是一次调用，而是一段有状态流程：提交 → 通道受理 → 到账确认（可能是数小时到数日）。中间任何一步都可能失败，且失败原因各异（账户信息错误、通道限额、合规拦截）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;payout_batch&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;batch_id&quot;: &quot;PB-20260928-DE-004&quot;,&#10;    &quot;identity_id&quot;: 88213,&#10;    &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;EUR&quot;,&#10;    &quot;amount_cents&quot;: 24580,&#10;    &quot;lines&quot;: [9011, 9012, 9033, 9044],&#10;    &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;sepa_credit_transfer&quot;,&#10;    &quot;state&quot;: &quot;submitted&quot;,&#10;    &quot;attempts&quot;: 1,&#10;    &quot;failure_code&quot;: null,&#10;    &quot;idempotency_key&quot;: &quot;PB-20260928-DE-004&quot;,&#10;    &quot;reconcile_state&quot;: &quot;pending&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"payout_batch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"batch_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PB-20260928-DE-004\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"identity_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">88213</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"amount_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24580</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lines\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9011</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9012</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9033</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9044</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sepa_credit_transfer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"submitted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"attempts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"failure_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"idempotency_key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PB-20260928-DE-004\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reconcile_state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pending\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>idempotency_key</code> 与 <code>attempts</code> 的组合是重试安全的关键：通道调用超时后重试，必须携带同一个幂等键，让通道侧去重。<strong>超时绝不等于失败</strong>——重试前必须先查询通道的批次状态，否则会造成重复打款，而重复打款的钱追回来极难。</p>\n<h3 id=\"合规扣除-代扣税与申报\">合规扣除：代扣税与申报</h3><p>众包司机在多数市场属于自雇或独立承包人，平台可能需要代扣代缴或至少做信息申报。工程上的影响是账本里需要多一类<strong>法定扣除行</strong>，其计算依赖司机的税务身份与所在地，且与报酬计算解耦——它是账本上的一笔独立分录，而不是费用项的一部分。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"INSERT INTO courier_ledger_entry&#10;  (identity_id, currency, entry_type, amount_cents, balance_after, source_ref)&#10;VALUES&#10;  ($1, $2, &#39;adjust&#39;, -$3, $4, $5)&#10;ON CONFLICT (identity_id, source_ref, entry_type) DO NOTHING;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> courier_ledger_entry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (identity_id, currency, entry_type, amount_cents, balance_after, source_ref)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ($</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'adjust'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CONFLICT (identity_id, source_ref, entry_type) DO NOTHING;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把法定扣除与报酬计算分开的重要性在于：税法变更只影响扣除行的计算规则，不触碰报酬本身；司机看到的&quot;收入&quot;与&quot;实际到账&quot;之间的差额也永远有明确的项对应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对账-账不平是最常见的线上事故\">对账：账不平是最常见的线上事故</h2><h3 id=\"三类对账\">三类对账</h3><p>结算系统每日需要跑三类对账，缺一不可：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对账类型</th>\n<th>比对对象</th>\n<th>不平时的典型原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内部一致性</td>\n<td>订单分账汇总 vs 账本分录累计</td>\n<td>漏记、重复记、并发写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与打款通道</td>\n<td>本地批次 vs 通道流水</td>\n<td>通道延迟、部分成功、手续费差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与业务系统</td>\n<td>妥投订单数 vs 生成分账的订单数</td>\n<td>状态机未推进、事件丢失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二类最容易产生&quot;看起来不平实则只是延迟&quot;的假警报，因此对账任务必须区分<strong>未到期</strong>与<strong>已逾期</strong>，只对超过通道 SLA 的差异告警。</p>\n<h3 id=\"差异归因与挂账\">差异归因与挂账</h3><p>对账差异不能靠手工平账，必须有归因流程：每笔差异落到一个<strong>差异类型</strong>（时序差、金额差、通道费、丢失），并按类型进入不同的处理路径——时序差自动等待重跑，金额差进入人工队列，丢失则触发补记。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE recon_exception (&#10;  exception_id  BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  recon_date    DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  scope         TEXT NOT NULL,     -- internal|channel|business&#10;  ref_type      TEXT NOT NULL,     -- batch|order|entry&#10;  ref_id        TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  diff_cents    BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  category      TEXT NOT NULL,     -- timing|amount|fee|missing|duplicate&#10;  state         TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;open&#39;,  -- open|auto_resolved|manual|resolved&#10;  resolution    TEXT,&#10;  created_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  CONSTRAINT uq_exception UNIQUE (recon_date, scope, ref_type, ref_id)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> recon_exception</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  exception_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  recon_date    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scope         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- internal|channel|business</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ref_type      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- batch|order|entry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ref_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  diff_cents    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  category      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- timing|amount|fee|missing|duplicate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'open'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- open|auto_resolved|manual|resolved</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  resolution    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uq_exception </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (recon_date, scope, ref_type, ref_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>uq_exception</code> 防止同一差异在每日重跑中被重复登记。<code>category</code> 字段是整个对账体系的价值所在——它让&quot;今天的差异比昨天多了 40 笔&quot;这个问题可以从一个数字变成一组成因，从而定位到具体是哪个上流系统出了变化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>结算有两个必须分开的粒度：订单级分账（这单产生了多少应付）与司机级账本（当前应收/已付/可提现），混在一张表会导致余额无法与明细对上。</li>\n<li>报酬构成必须是清单（<code>earning_line</code>）而非数字；<code>uq_line</code> 与 <code>uq_ledger</code> 两个唯一约束为重复消费与并发结算提供幂等保护。</li>\n<li>账本分录只增不改，更正用反向调整分录；余额恒等式应在写入时校验并每日全量重算比对。</li>\n<li>报酬需经冻结期后才可提现，冻结期长度应与妥投争议窗口匹配。</li>\n<li>打款是有状态流程，超时绝不等于失败：重试必须携带同一幂等键，且重试前先查询通道批次状态以避免重复打款。</li>\n<li>法定扣除与报酬计算解耦，作为独立分录记入账本。</li>\n<li>对账需覆盖内部一致性、打款通道、业务系统三类；差异必须按类型归因而非手工平账，<code>uq_exception</code> 防止重跑重复登记。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"众包运力报酬结算","id":"众包运力报酬结算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：订单级分账与司机级账本","id":"核心概念-订单级分账与司机级账本"},{"level":3,"text":"两个粒度的账","id":"两个粒度的账"},{"level":3,"text":"费用项的清单化","id":"费用项的清单化"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等分录与余额","id":"幂等分录与余额"},{"level":2,"text":"结算周期与打款","id":"结算周期与打款"},{"level":3,"text":"周期选择的经济含义","id":"周期选择的经济含义"},{"level":3,"text":"打款通道的失败处理","id":"打款通道的失败处理"},{"level":3,"text":"合规扣除：代扣税与申报","id":"合规扣除-代扣税与申报"},{"level":2,"text":"对账：账不平是最常见的线上事故","id":"对账-账不平是最常见的线上事故"},{"level":3,"text":"三类对账","id":"三类对账"},{"level":3,"text":"差异归因与挂账","id":"差异归因与挂账"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"司机评级与奖惩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdsourced-elastic-lastmile/crowd-quality-settlement/courier-rating-incentive"},"next":null}